## Slices

1. content — one slice for Vite static apps (no data-layer split)

**Delegation prompt for developer-static** (orchestrator copy-pastes this verbatim):

Write a self-contained prompt embedding:
- Role intro: "You are the developer-static subagent."
- Recipe citation + deviations (from Plan)
- Domain context files dev should Read
- `## Files to touch` section — each marked (NEW|EXISTING), what changes in each file
- Risks + edge cases (from Plan)
- Gate command (from Plan's **Gate** field)
- Session log path + "Populate ## Files Modified from git status --short, then call codegen-log section --slug <slug> --body @- to write your section body at canonical rank." `<slug>` = the build slug the orchestrator passed you in this task.

NO placeholder shapes. NO `<...>` slots. Write actual content. Orchestrator copies verbatim.

